WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,300
Photography makes sense

2
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,700
That being the case

3
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:11,300
Then give this kid another job.

4
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:14,610
The Duke of Lu is here

5
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:18,010
Let that kid report to the Wucheng Military and Horse Division under your jurisdiction.

6
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:19,610
As for the position

7
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:21,010
You make arrangements for him

8
00:00:21,010 --> 00:00:23,410
I obeyed the order

9
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:25,610
That’s the end of today’s court meeting.

10
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:38,990
Congratulations, young master

11
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:39,990
Where is the joy?

12
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:43,190
I don’t want to go to Wucheng Bingma County Young Master

13
00:00:43,190 --> 00:00:44,890
All the imperial edicts were accepted

14
00:00:44,890 --> 00:00:46,490
Not going would be a lie.

15
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:47,690
What a big deal

16
00:00:47,690 --> 00:00:49,490
Let's find someone to take over for a few days first.

17
00:00:49,490 --> 00:00:50,490
Did my dad reply?

18
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:51,890
I'll get it right away
